ally (no system-wide install or gmp dependency required)\nL214: ## Build\nL215: \nL216:     g++ -O3 -std=c++17 main.cpp \\\nL217:       -I. -I$HOME/mcl-src/include \\\nL218:       -L$HOME/mcl-src/lib -Wl,-rpath,$HOME/mcl-src/lib \\\nL219:       -o celer -lmcl\nL220: \nL221: ## Run\nL222: \nL223: The executable takes two arguments: table size `n`, query size `m`.\nL224: \nL225: Both arguments should be powers of two, written in the form 2^k, for example:\nL226: \nL227:     ./celer 2^16 2^20\nL228: \nL229: ## About\nL230: \nL231: Code for paper Celer: A Lookup Argument for Large-Scale Queries\nL232: \nL233: ### Resources\nL234: \nL235: 【71†Readme】\nL236: \nL237: 【72†Activity】\nL238: \nL239: ### Stars\nL240: \nL241: 1 star\nL242: \nL243: ### Watchers\nL244: \nL245: 0 watching\nL246: ### Forks\nL247: \nL248: 【73†0 forks】\nL249: \nL250: 【74†Report repository】\nL251: \nL252: ## Releases\nL253: \nL254: ## Packages\nL255: \nL256: ## Contributors\nL257: \nL258: ## Languages\nL259: \nL260: You can’t perform that action at this time.\n"
